// @id ovw-checks
// @tab overview
// @title Check pass rate (unique checks, latest Fresh report per machine and family)
// @note Source: guestconfigurationresources assignments; checks are the unique properties.latestAssignmentReport.resources[].resourceId per report.
// @note percent = unique checks Compliant / unique checks total. Reasons are never counted as checks.
// @note Only reports with endTime within 24h of now() are included. Stale and unknown-age reports are excluded (reportsExcludedAsNotFresh) and are never treated as passing.
// @note A duplicate check key within one report keeps the worst status (matches the app normalizer).
// @note ARG exposes the latest report only; it is not a guarantee of full report content. Compare with the report GET for a selected machine.
// @nodata No Fresh report with checks in scope.
//#include checkrows
| summarize total = countif(quality == 'Fresh' and isnotempty(checkKey)), passed = countif(quality == 'Fresh' and isnotempty(checkKey) and checkStatus == 'Compliant'), reportsExcludedAsNotFresh = dcountif(machineId, quality in ('Stale', 'UnknownAge')) by family
| extend percent = iff(total == 0, real(null), round(100.0 * passed / total, 2))
| project family, percent, passed, failed = total - passed, total, reportsExcludedAsNotFresh
| order by family asc
